      "role": "In-page emphasis on dollar amounts or key facts",
      "description": "National 2 Compressed 115–147px weight 700, line-height 0.80, letter-spacing -0.0100em. Always in #000000 on light sections, or #fdf0af on dark sections. A superscript footnote numeral (¹ ² ³) is rendered inline at 1/4 the headline size in the same weight."
    }
